1
00:00:01,797 --> 00:00:03,757
Administrator:
WELL, IT’S ABOUT TIME.

2
00:00:03,757 --> 00:00:07,347
I KNEW THAT, IF I TORMENTED
THESE CHILDREN LONG ENOUGH,

3
00:00:07,347 --> 00:00:10,227
YOU’D EMERGE FROM
YOUR MUSTY HOLE SOONER OR LATER.

4
00:00:10,227 --> 00:00:13,647
Cardinal: HMPH!
TIME HAS BEEN KIND TO YOU.

5
00:00:13,647 --> 00:00:16,857
IF I DIDN’T KNOW BETTER,
YOU COULD ALMOST PASS FOR HUMAN.

6
00:00:16,857 --> 00:00:19,357
Administrator: MY, MY.
HOW CAVALIER YOU’VE BECOME.

7
00:00:19,357 --> 00:00:20,777
YOU WERE NOTHING LIKE THIS

8
00:00:20,777 --> 00:00:22,777
THE LAST TIME I SAW YOU,
LITTLE ONE.

9
00:00:22,777 --> 00:00:26,367
YOU WERE SO TIMID.
WHY, WHEN YOU STOOD BEFORE ME

10
00:00:26,367 --> 00:00:29,367
TWO CENTURIES AGO, YOUR TEETH
COULDN’T STOP CHATTERING.

11
00:00:29,367 --> 00:00:32,077
REMEMBER, LYSERITH?

12
00:00:32,077 --> 00:00:34,377
Cardinal: DO NOT CALL ME
BY THAT NAME, QUINELLA!

13
00:00:34,377 --> 00:00:36,707
MY NAME IS CARDINAL.

14
00:00:36,707 --> 00:00:40,587
I AM A PROGRAM WITH
ONE DIRECTIVE, DELETING YOU.

15
00:00:40,587 --> 00:00:41,677
( Administrator laughs )

16
00:00:41,677 --> 00:00:43,677
THAT’S RIGHT. YOU ARE.

17
00:00:43,677 --> 00:00:46,177
HOWEVER, MY NAME
IS ADMINISTRATOR,

18
00:00:46,177 --> 00:00:49,307
AND MY DIRECTIVE
IS TO MANAGE ALL PROGRAMS.

19
00:00:49,307 --> 00:00:52,767
I’M SORRY IT TOOK SO LONG
FOR US TO MEET AGAIN.

20
00:00:52,767 --> 00:00:56,527
BUT, YOU SEE, I WAS PREPARING
A SPECIAL ART TO WELCOME YOU,

21
00:00:56,527 --> 00:00:59,397
AND FINISHING IT
TOOK LONGER THAN EXPECTED.

22
00:01:02,527 --> 00:01:04,617
( Kirito gasps )

23
00:01:09,747 --> 00:01:11,667
♪

24
00:01:13,997 --> 00:01:17,627
Cardinal: DAMN YOU!
YOU CUT THE ADDRESS LOOSE.

25
00:01:17,627 --> 00:01:20,797
Administrator: I CAME SO CLOSE
TO KILLING YOU 200 YEARS AGO,

26
00:01:20,797 --> 00:01:23,507
BUT I LET YOU
SLIP THROUGH MY FINGERS,

27
00:01:23,507 --> 00:01:26,097
AND I WANTED TO MAKE SURE
THAT DIDN’T HAPPEN AGAIN.

28
00:01:26,097 --> 00:01:27,217
( snaps fingers )

29
00:01:27,217 --> 00:01:28,807
SO...

30
00:01:28,807 --> 00:01:32,097
I LEARNED FROM MY MISTAKE
AND CAME UP WITH A PLAN.

31
00:01:32,097 --> 00:01:34,597
ALL I HAD TO DO
WAS LURE YOU OUT AGAIN

32
00:01:34,597 --> 00:01:37,227
AND TRAP YOU
ON THIS SIDE WITH ME,

33
00:01:37,227 --> 00:01:40,687
LIKE A MOUSE
IN THE SAME CAGE WITH A CAT.

34
00:01:40,687 --> 00:01:42,697
Cardinal: AT THIS POINT,
IT IS NOT CLEAR

35
00:01:42,697 --> 00:01:44,947
WHO IS THE MOUSE
AND WHO IS THE CAT.

36
00:01:44,947 --> 00:01:47,197
YOU ARE TRAPPED IN HERE AS WELL.

37
00:01:47,197 --> 00:01:49,697
AND, AS YOU CAN PLAINLY SEE,

38
00:01:49,697 --> 00:01:52,747
THERE ARE FOUR OF US
AND ONLY ONE OF YOU.

39
00:01:52,747 --> 00:01:54,457
Administrator:
FOUR AGAINST ONE, YOU SAY?

40
00:01:54,457 --> 00:01:59,047
HARDLY! YOUR NUMBERS ARE OFF
BY A WIDE MARGIN, LITTLE ONE.

41
00:02:02,547 --> 00:02:03,427
Cardinal: WHAT?

42
00:02:03,427 --> 00:02:06,637
♪

43
00:02:06,637 --> 00:02:08,217
Administrator: IN FACT--

44
00:02:08,217 --> 00:02:10,637
AND THIS DOES NOT
INCLUDE MYSELF, MIND YOU--

45
00:02:10,637 --> 00:02:12,387
IT’S FOUR AGAINST 300.

46
00:02:12,387 --> 00:02:14,307
Kirito: 300 WHAT?

47
00:02:14,307 --> 00:02:15,017
( gasps )

48
00:02:19,817 --> 00:02:21,937
Cardinal: YOU VILE MONSTER.

49
00:02:21,937 --> 00:02:24,487
IS THERE NO LIMIT
TO YOUR DEPRAVITY?

50
00:02:24,487 --> 00:02:26,817
YOUR DUTY IS
TO PROTECT YOUR SUBJECTS,

51
00:02:26,817 --> 00:02:28,447
AND YOU TURNED THEM INTO THAT?!

52
00:02:28,447 --> 00:02:31,947
Eugeo: WAIT. "SUBJECTS"?
THAT THING...

53
00:02:31,947 --> 00:02:35,667
Alice: THEN, THAT MONSTER,
AT ITS CORE, IS HUMAN?

54
00:02:35,667 --> 00:02:37,787
Administrator:
YOU SAY SUCH SILLY THINGS

55
00:02:37,787 --> 00:02:41,127
ABOUT TRIFLES SUCH AS DUTIES
AND SUBJECTS TO PROTECT.

56
00:02:42,417 --> 00:02:44,087
I AM A CONQUEROR.

57
00:02:44,087 --> 00:02:47,427
I HAVE NO PROBLEM,
AS LONG AS WHATEVER I RULE OVER

58
00:02:47,427 --> 00:02:50,427
REMAINS SUBSERVIENT
AND OBEYS MY WILL.

59
00:02:50,427 --> 00:02:53,807
WHETHER THEY BE SWORD OR HUMAN
MATTERS NOT TO ME.

60
00:02:53,807 --> 00:02:56,057
( Cardinal gasps )
YOU HORRID--

61
00:02:56,057 --> 00:02:57,477
Administrator:
OH, NOW, DON’T TELL ME

62
00:02:57,477 --> 00:02:59,357
YOU’RE SHOCKED
THAT I USED A LITTLE THING

63
00:02:59,357 --> 00:03:02,027
LIKE MATTER CONVERSION
ON HUMAN UNITS.

64
00:03:02,027 --> 00:03:04,687
IT WAS ONLY A MEASLY 300 OR SO.

65
00:03:04,687 --> 00:03:07,357
Cardinal: YOU ARE EVIL.

66
00:03:07,357 --> 00:03:09,867
Administrator: THIS ONE IS
JUST A PROTOTYPE, BY THE WAY.

67
00:03:09,867 --> 00:03:13,447
IN ORDER TO MASS-PRODUCE
THE FINAL VERSION

68
00:03:13,447 --> 00:03:16,117
IN SUFFICIENT NUMBERS
TO HANDLE THE STRESS TEST,

69
00:03:16,117 --> 00:03:18,877
I EXPECT I WILL NEED,
OH, ABOUT HALF.

70
00:03:18,877 --> 00:03:20,997
Cardinal: HALF OF WHAT?

71
00:03:20,997 --> 00:03:24,757
Administrator: WHY, NATURALLY
OF THE 80,000 HUMAN UNITS

72
00:03:24,757 --> 00:03:26,717
LIVING IN THE HUMAN EMPIRE.

73
00:03:26,717 --> 00:03:29,257
YES, THAT AMOUNT
SHOULD BE ENOUGH, I THINK,

74
00:03:29,257 --> 00:03:32,217
TO REPEL THE ARMIES
OF THE DARK TERRITORY

75
00:03:32,217 --> 00:03:34,347
AND TAKE THE FIGHT
BACK TO THEIR SIDE.

76
00:03:34,347 --> 00:03:37,097
( all gasp )

77
00:03:37,097 --> 00:03:40,897
Administrator: WELL? I HOPE THAT
ALLAYS YOUR FEARS, LITTLE ALICE.

78
00:03:40,897 --> 00:03:44,187
YOUR PRECIOUS HUMAN EMPIRE
WILL BE MORE THAN PROTECTED.

79
00:03:45,857 --> 00:03:47,277
Alice: MADAM PONTIFEX,

80
00:03:47,277 --> 00:03:50,987
IT IS CLEAR MY WORDS
CANNOT REACH YOU NOW.

81
00:03:50,987 --> 00:03:53,987
THEREFORE, AS A FELLOW
SACRED-ARTS USER,

82
00:03:53,987 --> 00:03:56,827
I WOULD LIKE TO KNOW
WHERE THE OWNERS ARE

83
00:03:56,827 --> 00:04:00,877
OF THE 30 SWORDS YOU FASHIONED
THAT MONSTROSITY OUT OF.

84
00:04:00,877 --> 00:04:02,957
EVEN IF YOU FLOUTED THE RULE

85
00:04:02,957 --> 00:04:05,457
ALLOWING PERFECT CONTROL
OVER ONE WEAPON,

86
00:04:05,457 --> 00:04:09,757
PONTIFEX OR NO,
YOU CANNOT BREAK THE NEXT RULE.

87
00:04:09,757 --> 00:04:11,887
TO ACTIVATE MEMORY RELEASE,

88
00:04:11,887 --> 00:04:15,847
THERE MUST BE A BOND BETWEEN
THE WEAPON AND ITS OWNER.

89
00:04:15,847 --> 00:04:19,897
PONTIFEX, IF YOU
TRULY USED INNOCENT HUMANS

90
00:04:19,897 --> 00:04:22,937
AS THE SOURCE OF THE BLADES
WHICH MAKE UP THAT THING,

91
00:04:22,937 --> 00:04:26,897
THERE IS NO WAY THEY
WOULD FORM A BOND WITH YOU!

92
00:04:26,897 --> 00:04:28,197
Administrator: THE EXPLANATION

93
00:04:28,197 --> 00:04:30,907
IS HIDING IN PLAIN SIGHT,
MY DEAR.

94
00:04:30,907 --> 00:04:34,367
EUGEO SEEMS TO HAVE
ALREADY DISCOVERED IT.

95
00:04:34,367 --> 00:04:35,737
( Kirito gasps )

96
00:04:35,737 --> 00:04:39,077
Eugeo: NO. NO!

97
00:04:40,537 --> 00:04:41,577
( Kirito gasps )

98
00:04:41,577 --> 00:04:43,837
WHAT?

99
00:04:43,837 --> 00:04:47,007
Eugeo: SEE THE CRYSTALS
ON THE CEILING?

100
00:04:47,007 --> 00:04:49,837
THEY’RE NOT DECORATIONS.

101
00:04:49,837 --> 00:04:51,887
THEY’RE WHAT SHE STOLE
FROM THE KNIGHTS

102
00:04:51,887 --> 00:04:53,347
WITH THE SYNTHESIS RITUAL.

103
00:04:53,347 --> 00:04:54,677
THOSE ARE THEIR MEMORIES!

104
00:04:54,677 --> 00:04:56,637
( both gasp )

105
00:04:56,637 --> 00:04:59,637
Cardinal: CURSE YOU,
QUINELLA, YOU FIEND!

106
00:04:59,637 --> 00:05:02,557
TOYING LIKE THIS WITH THE HUMANS
IS BEYOND TWISTED!

107
00:05:02,557 --> 00:05:05,567
YOU PLACED
THE MEMORY FRAGMENTS YOU STOLE

108
00:05:05,567 --> 00:05:08,567
INTO MENTAL MODELS
ON FRESH LIGHTCUBES.

109
00:05:08,567 --> 00:05:12,237
THAT IS ALL IT WOULD TAKE TO
CREATE SIMULATED HUMAN BEINGS.

110
00:05:12,237 --> 00:05:15,407
BUT THEIR INTELLIGENCE
WOULD BE SEVERELY LIMITED,

111
00:05:15,407 --> 00:05:17,487
AND THEY WOULD
NOT BE ABLE TO EXECUTE

112
00:05:17,487 --> 00:05:21,077
AN ADVANCED COMMAND
SUCH AS PERFECT WEAPON CONTROL.

113
00:05:21,077 --> 00:05:24,707
BUT YOU CAN GET AROUND THAT
IF THE MEMORY FRAGMENT

114
00:05:24,707 --> 00:05:27,957
AND THE WEAPON IT IS LINKED TO
SHARE THE SAME STRUCTURAL DATA.

115
00:05:27,957 --> 00:05:31,167
THE MEMORIES OF PEOPLE
THE KNIGHTS ONCE HELD DEAR,

116
00:05:31,167 --> 00:05:34,587
THE MEMORIES YOU STOLE
AND CARVED ONTO THESE CRYSTALS,

117
00:05:34,587 --> 00:05:36,427
THEY ARE
WHAT YOUR GOLEM IS MADE OF!

118
00:05:36,427 --> 00:05:37,757
ISN’T THAT RIGHT?!

119
00:05:41,977 --> 00:05:45,017
Administrator: THESE ARTIFICIAL
PERSONAS DESIRE BUT ONE THING,

120
00:05:45,017 --> 00:05:47,897
TO FIND THE ONE THEY REMEMBER,

121
00:05:47,897 --> 00:05:51,027
TOUCH THEM, HOLD THEM,
POSSESS THEM.

122
00:05:51,027 --> 00:05:53,947
UNSEEMLY DESIRE
COURSES THROUGHOUT THIS PUPPET

123
00:05:53,947 --> 00:05:55,987
AND PROVIDES ITS MOTIVATION.

124
00:05:55,987 --> 00:05:58,657
THEY SENSE THE ONES
THEY REMEMBER ARE NEAR,

125
00:05:58,657 --> 00:06:02,207
BUT THEY CANNOT TOUCH THEM.
THEY CANNOT BE ONE WITH THEM.

126
00:06:02,207 --> 00:06:04,327
THEIR THIRST
FOR THAT CONNECTION DRIVES THEM

127
00:06:04,327 --> 00:06:07,747
TO THE POINT OF MADNESS,
BUT ALL THEY CAN SEE NOW

128
00:06:07,747 --> 00:06:10,337
ARE THE ENEMIES
STANDING IN THEIR WAY.

129
00:06:10,337 --> 00:06:12,627
THEY THINK,
IF THEY CAN DESTROY YOU,

130
00:06:12,627 --> 00:06:14,837
THE ONE THEY DESIRE
WILL BECOME THEIRS.

131
00:06:14,837 --> 00:06:16,217
THAT IS WHY THEY FIGHT.

132
00:06:16,217 --> 00:06:18,757
AND, NO MATTER
HOW BADLY THEY’RE WOUNDED

133
00:06:18,757 --> 00:06:20,557
OR HOW MANY TIMES THEY FALL,

134
00:06:20,557 --> 00:06:22,727
THEY’LL KEEP FIGHTING
FOR ETERNITY.

135
00:06:22,727 --> 00:06:25,437
I DESIGNED IT
RATHER WELL, DID I NOT?

136
00:06:25,437 --> 00:06:26,857
THE POWER OF DESIRE

137
00:06:26,857 --> 00:06:29,437
CAN ACHIEVE GREAT THINGS
IF HARNESSED PROPERLY.

138
00:06:31,987 --> 00:06:33,817
Cardinal: YOU’RE WRONG!

139
00:06:33,817 --> 00:06:35,737
DON’T YOU DARE
TARNISH THAT EMOTION

140
00:06:35,737 --> 00:06:37,657
BY CALLING IT DESIRE!

141
00:06:37,657 --> 00:06:39,907
WHAT THEY FEEL IS--

142
00:06:39,907 --> 00:06:42,077
IS PURE LOVE!

143
00:06:42,077 --> 00:06:43,407
Administrator:
WELL, NOW YOU’RE

144
00:06:43,407 --> 00:06:44,827
JUST SPLITTING HAIRS,
LITTLE ONE.

145
00:06:46,457 --> 00:06:48,957
LOVE IS CONTROL.

146
00:06:48,957 --> 00:06:51,587
LOVE IS DESIRE.

147
00:06:51,587 --> 00:06:54,717
EITHER WAY, IT IS A SIGNAL
PRODUCED BY A FLUCTLIGHT,

148
00:06:54,717 --> 00:06:56,837
NOTHING MORE,

149
00:06:56,837 --> 00:07:00,007
WHICH BRINGS US
TO AN EVEN GREATER REVELATION.

150
00:07:00,007 --> 00:07:01,807
( chuckles )

151
00:07:01,807 --> 00:07:05,767
NOW THAT YOU KNOW THE TRUTH
ABOUT MY FEARSOME PUPPET,

152
00:07:05,767 --> 00:07:07,807
YOU CANNOT DESTROY IT,

153
00:07:07,807 --> 00:07:10,147
BECAUSE...

154
00:07:10,147 --> 00:07:13,397
EVERY SINGLE BLADE
IS A LIVING HUMAN BEING

155
00:07:13,397 --> 00:07:15,567
WHO HAS BEEN TRANSFORMED
INTO A SWORD.

156
00:07:15,567 --> 00:07:17,407
( Cardinal gasping )

157
00:07:20,487 --> 00:07:23,157
YES, YOU’RE RIGHT.

158
00:07:23,157 --> 00:07:26,077
I CANNOT KILL A HUMAN.

159
00:07:26,077 --> 00:07:28,707
I SPENT THE PAST 200 YEARS

160
00:07:28,707 --> 00:07:32,167
HONING AN ART TO KILL YOU
AND YOUR INHUMAN FORM,

161
00:07:32,167 --> 00:07:34,797
BUT IT WAS ALL FOR NOTHING.

162
00:07:34,797 --> 00:07:37,007
( Administrator laughs )

163
00:07:37,007 --> 00:07:41,007
YOU ARE SUCH A FOOL!
IT’S BOTH FUNNY AND TRAGIC!

164
00:07:41,007 --> 00:07:43,847
YOU KNEW THAT ALL LIFE
IN THIS WORLD

165
00:07:43,847 --> 00:07:46,477
WAS JUST A COLLECTION OF DATA
THAT CAN BE REWRITTEN,

166
00:07:46,477 --> 00:07:48,727
AND YET YOU TREAT IT AS HUMAN.

167
00:07:48,727 --> 00:07:51,227
Cardinal: I DID,
BECAUSE THEY ARE HUMAN.

168
00:07:51,227 --> 00:07:53,647
THE PEOPLE OF THE UNDERWORLD

169
00:07:53,647 --> 00:07:56,567
HAVE THE EMOTIONS
YOU AND I LOST, QUINELLA.

170
00:07:56,567 --> 00:08:01,617
THEY CAN LAUGH, GRIEVE,
FEEL JOY AND LOVE.

171
00:08:01,617 --> 00:08:04,197
THAT IS WHAT MAKES THEM HUMAN.

172
00:08:04,197 --> 00:08:05,287
( groans )

173
00:08:12,627 --> 00:08:14,587
I WILL LET YOU TAKE MY LIFE.

174
00:08:14,587 --> 00:08:16,837
BUT FIRST I WANT YOUR WORD

175
00:08:16,837 --> 00:08:18,587
THAT YOU WILL SPARE
THESE YOUNG ONES!

176
00:08:18,587 --> 00:08:19,797
Kirito: NO! YOU CAN’T--

177
00:08:19,797 --> 00:08:21,507
♪

178
00:08:23,757 --> 00:08:25,267
Administrator: OUT OF CURIOSITY,

179
00:08:25,267 --> 00:08:27,477
LET US SAY
I ACCEPTED YOUR OFFER.

180
00:08:27,477 --> 00:08:29,387
WHAT WOULD I STAND
TO GAIN FROM IT?

181
00:08:29,387 --> 00:08:31,857
Cardinal: IF YOU
DECIDE TO FIGHT,

182
00:08:31,857 --> 00:08:35,067
I WILL NOT ONLY KEEP
YOUR PATHETIC PUPPET AT BAY,

183
00:08:35,067 --> 00:08:37,987
I WILL SHAVE OFF AT LEAST
HALF OF YOUR LIFE AS WELL.

184
00:08:37,987 --> 00:08:41,157
THE LOSS OF THAT WOULD PUT
AN EVEN GREATER STRAIN

185
00:08:41,157 --> 00:08:45,787
ON YOUR ALREADY DWINDLING
MEMORY CAPACITY, WOULD IT NOT?

186
00:08:45,787 --> 00:08:47,577
Administrator: HMM.

187
00:08:47,577 --> 00:08:49,457
VERY WELL, THEN.

188
00:08:52,537 --> 00:08:54,037
LETTING THEM GO NOW

189
00:08:54,037 --> 00:08:57,297
GIVES ME SOMETHING
TO LOOK FORWARD TO LATER. HEH!

190
00:08:57,297 --> 00:09:00,337
ALL RIGHT. I SWEAR
ON THE GODDESS STACIA,

191
00:09:00,337 --> 00:09:03,257
- AFTER I KILL--
- Cardinal: NO, NOT ON A GOD.

192
00:09:03,257 --> 00:09:06,057
YOU’LL SWEAR ON THE ONE THING
YOU VALUE MOST,

193
00:09:06,057 --> 00:09:08,137
YOUR FLUCTLIGHT,
OR THE DEAL IS OFF.

194
00:09:08,137 --> 00:09:09,477
Administrator: FINE, FINE.

195
00:09:09,477 --> 00:09:12,847
I HEREBY SWEAR
ON MY FLUCTLIGHT

196
00:09:12,847 --> 00:09:16,477
AND ALL THE PRECIOUS DATA
I’VE ACCUMULATED UP TO NOW,

197
00:09:16,477 --> 00:09:18,817
AFTER I’VE KILLED YOU,
LITTLE ONE,

198
00:09:18,817 --> 00:09:21,237
I SHALL ALLOW THOSE THREE
TO ESCAPE UNHARMED.

199
00:09:21,237 --> 00:09:22,947
Cardinal: YOU HAD BETTER.

200
00:09:28,287 --> 00:09:29,617
( Kirito gasps )

201
00:09:31,157 --> 00:09:32,537
Cardinal: I AM SORRY.

202
00:09:45,217 --> 00:09:46,137
Administrator: HMPH.

203
00:09:49,057 --> 00:09:49,967
( Cardinal grunts )

204
00:09:53,097 --> 00:09:54,687
( chuckles )

205
00:09:54,687 --> 00:09:56,307
WAS THAT YOUR BEST?

206
00:09:56,307 --> 00:09:58,067
FIRE ALL YOU WANT. I--

207
00:10:04,947 --> 00:10:06,867
( gasping )

208
00:10:08,907 --> 00:10:11,997
Administrator: I’M HOLDING BACK
FOR NOW, LITTLE ONE.

209
00:10:11,997 --> 00:10:15,417
AFTER ALL, WHAT FUN WOULD IT BE
IF I DISPATCHED YOU QUICKLY?

210
00:10:15,417 --> 00:10:18,627
I HAVE BEEN WAITING
200 YEARS FOR THIS MOMENT!

211
00:10:19,957 --> 00:10:20,957
( Cardinal groans )

212
00:10:25,637 --> 00:10:26,387
( shrieks )

213
00:10:28,807 --> 00:10:31,307
( Administrator chuckling )

214
00:10:31,307 --> 00:10:33,887
( laughing )

215
00:10:41,227 --> 00:10:42,987
- ( Kirito growls )
- Cardinal: STAY BACK!

216
00:10:48,117 --> 00:10:49,617
Eugeo: I CAN’T HELP.

217
00:10:49,617 --> 00:10:52,697
ALL I CAN DO IS
STAND HERE POWERLESS.

218
00:10:52,697 --> 00:10:53,957
( gasps )

219
00:10:53,957 --> 00:10:55,667
THINK!

220
00:10:55,667 --> 00:10:58,627
THERE HAS TO BE
SOMETHING I CAN DO.

221
00:10:58,627 --> 00:11:00,997
INSTEAD OF WHINING
ABOUT BEING WEAK,

222
00:11:00,997 --> 00:11:03,547
FIND A WAY TO FIGHT BACK.

223
00:11:03,547 --> 00:11:07,137
Administrator: NOW TO FINISH
OUR CENTURIES-LONG GAME.

224
00:11:07,137 --> 00:11:09,257
FAREWELL, DEAR LYSERITH.

225
00:11:09,257 --> 00:11:11,137
FAREWELL, MY ONLY DAUGHTER.

226
00:11:11,137 --> 00:11:13,097
FAREWELL...

227
00:11:13,097 --> 00:11:15,057
MY OTHER SELF!

228
00:11:24,817 --> 00:11:26,857
( chuckles )

229
00:11:26,857 --> 00:11:28,527
( laughing )

230
00:11:30,827 --> 00:11:32,487
♪

231
00:11:34,787 --> 00:11:37,957
Kirito: SORRY. I’M SO SORRY.

232
00:11:37,957 --> 00:11:40,747
Cardinal: NO NEED TO APOLOGIZE.

233
00:11:40,747 --> 00:11:44,257
YOU STILL HAVE A MISSION...

234
00:11:44,257 --> 00:11:47,587
TO FULFILL, DON’T YOU?

235
00:11:47,587 --> 00:11:51,177
THE THREE OF YOU,
SAVE THIS WORLD,

236
00:11:51,177 --> 00:11:53,807
FRAGILE, BEAUTIFUL.

237
00:11:53,807 --> 00:11:56,637
Alice: WE WILL, NO MATTER WHAT.

238
00:11:56,637 --> 00:12:00,727
YOU HAVE GIVEN ME
A SECOND CHANCE,

239
00:12:00,727 --> 00:12:03,357
AND I SHALL USE IT
TO DEFEND THIS WORLD.

240
00:12:03,357 --> 00:12:05,687
( crying )

241
00:12:13,077 --> 00:12:14,447
- Girl: EUGEO...
- ( Eugeo gasps )

242
00:12:21,577 --> 00:12:24,457
THAT’S IT.
I FINALLY FIGURED IT OUT.

243
00:12:24,457 --> 00:12:26,337
I KNOW WHAT MY PURPOSE
IS SUPPOSED TO BE.

244
00:12:27,837 --> 00:12:30,217
I’M NOT GOING TO RUN AWAY.

245
00:12:30,217 --> 00:12:32,177
I’M GOING TO STAY
AND FULFILL MY DUTY.

246
00:12:32,177 --> 00:12:33,677
( Kirito gasps )

247
00:12:35,307 --> 00:12:37,137
Eugeo: PLEASE, CARDINAL,

248
00:12:37,137 --> 00:12:39,977
WITH WHATEVER STRENGTH
YOU HAVE LEFT,

249
00:12:39,977 --> 00:12:42,227
I WANT YOU
TO TURN ME INTO A SWORD...

250
00:12:44,317 --> 00:12:46,277
JUST LIKE HER PUPPET.

251
00:12:48,027 --> 00:12:50,777
♪

252
00:12:50,777 --> 00:12:52,027
( Kirito gasps )

253
00:12:54,367 --> 00:12:57,827
Cardinal: EUGEO, YOU CAN’T...

254
00:12:57,827 --> 00:12:59,497
Eugeo: EVEN IF SHE LETS US GO,

255
00:12:59,497 --> 00:13:03,877
ADMINISTRATOR WILL STILL CHANGE
HALF THE PEOPLE INTO GOLEMS.

256
00:13:03,877 --> 00:13:06,587
WE CAN’T LET HER
DO THAT TO THEM.

257
00:13:06,587 --> 00:13:10,167
IF THERE’S ANY CHANCE LEFT
TO STOP HER,

258
00:13:10,167 --> 00:13:11,427
ANY HOPE LEFT AT ALL,

259
00:13:11,427 --> 00:13:15,387
THIS SACRED ART MUST BE IT.

260
00:13:15,387 --> 00:13:18,347
SYSTEM CALL.

261
00:13:18,347 --> 00:13:19,727
REMOVE CORE PROTECTION.

262
00:13:29,237 --> 00:13:32,107
GO AHEAD NOW. CHANGE ME.

263
00:13:32,107 --> 00:13:34,197
THE BOND BETWEEN US IS STRONG,

264
00:13:34,197 --> 00:13:37,197
MUCH STRONGER
THAN HER AND THAT MONSTER’S.

265
00:13:37,197 --> 00:13:39,077
Kirito: STOP IT! DON’T DO THIS.

266
00:13:39,077 --> 00:13:43,747
Eugeo: IT’S OKAY.
THIS IS WHAT I WAS MEANT TO DO.

267
00:13:53,967 --> 00:13:55,637
Cardinal: VERY WELL, EUGEO.

268
00:13:55,637 --> 00:13:58,467
THE FINAL ART I CAST IN LIFE

269
00:13:58,467 --> 00:14:01,847
WILL GO TOWARD YOUR OBJECTIVE.

270
00:14:03,847 --> 00:14:06,187
Eugeo: HOLD ON. BEFORE I GO,

271
00:14:06,187 --> 00:14:08,017
I NEED TO TELL YOU
ONE LAST THING.

272
00:14:08,017 --> 00:14:11,567
METAL WEAPONS DON’T WORK
ON THE PONTIFEX.

273
00:14:11,567 --> 00:14:14,237
THAT’S WHY I COULDN’T
STAB HER WITH MY DAGGER.

274
00:14:14,237 --> 00:14:15,777
( Kirito sighs )

275
00:14:30,087 --> 00:14:32,217
♪

276
00:14:44,517 --> 00:14:45,227
Administrator: NOW WHAT?

277
00:14:54,357 --> 00:14:56,357
WHAT DO YOU THINK YOU’RE DOING?!

278
00:14:56,357 --> 00:14:57,567
WOULD YOU DIE, ALREADY?!

279
00:14:57,567 --> 00:14:58,617
Alice: NO, YOU DON’T!

280
00:14:58,617 --> 00:14:59,617
♪

281
00:14:59,617 --> 00:15:01,657
( groans )

282
00:15:05,157 --> 00:15:07,037
YOUR LIGHTNING
WILL NOT WORK ON ME!

283
00:15:07,037 --> 00:15:09,207
Administrator:
YOU INSOLENT LITTLE KNIGHT.

284
00:15:09,207 --> 00:15:10,667
HOW DARE YOU DEFY ME?

285
00:15:13,417 --> 00:15:16,127
I SHALL BURN
ALL THREE OF YOU TO CINDERS!

286
00:15:18,887 --> 00:15:21,387
Alice: AND I
SHALL STOP YOU AGAIN!

287
00:15:21,387 --> 00:15:22,927
( grunts )

288
00:15:22,927 --> 00:15:24,847
( chorus vocalizing )

289
00:15:29,557 --> 00:15:31,477
- ( gasps )
- ( Administrator gasps )

290
00:15:49,747 --> 00:15:52,587
Cardinal: RELEASE RECOLLECTION.

291
00:15:59,677 --> 00:16:01,757
♪

292
00:16:01,757 --> 00:16:04,217
Administrator:
YOU CAN MIMIC MY SPELL, FOOL.

293
00:16:04,217 --> 00:16:06,847
HOWEVER, ONE PALTRY SWORD

294
00:16:06,847 --> 00:16:10,227
IS NO MATCH
AGAINST MY GOLEM OF 30 BLADES.

295
00:16:10,227 --> 00:16:12,817
IT WILL SNAP IT IN HALF
WITH A SINGLE BLOW!

296
00:16:29,287 --> 00:16:33,037
Cardinal: HUMAN LOVE, BEAUTIFUL.

297
00:16:33,037 --> 00:16:36,667
THE SHINING LIGHT OF PURPOSE,

298
00:16:36,667 --> 00:16:39,507
SO BEAUTIFUL.

299
00:16:39,507 --> 00:16:42,427
Kirito: YEAH. IT IS.

300
00:16:42,427 --> 00:16:46,677
Cardinal: KIRITO, I MUST GO NOW.

301
00:16:46,677 --> 00:16:50,387
PROTECT THIS WORLD, ITS PEOPLE.

302
00:16:50,387 --> 00:16:53,807
I LEAVE IT TO YOU.

303
00:17:04,657 --> 00:17:06,577
♪

304
00:17:12,577 --> 00:17:13,577
( Administrator gasps )

305
00:17:32,597 --> 00:17:34,437
Kirito: EUGEO.

306
00:17:37,317 --> 00:17:38,777
Administrator: WELL, WELL.

307
00:17:38,777 --> 00:17:41,487
YOU WANT TO FIGHT SOME MORE,
LITTLE BOY?

308
00:17:41,487 --> 00:17:44,447
DO NOT MAKE THE MISTAKE
OF BECOMING OVERCONFIDENT

309
00:17:44,447 --> 00:17:46,827
JUST BECAUSE
YOU DEMOLISHED MY PUPPET.

310
00:17:50,287 --> 00:17:52,367
Kirito: DON’T DO IT.

311
00:17:52,367 --> 00:17:54,207
DON’T GO.

312
00:17:54,207 --> 00:17:54,877
EUGEO!

313
00:18:00,627 --> 00:18:03,587
( Administrator laughs )

314
00:18:04,717 --> 00:18:06,217
Kirito: EUGEO!

315
00:18:10,217 --> 00:18:12,477
Administrator:
YOU WRETCHED BRAT!

316
00:18:14,187 --> 00:18:14,847
( Kirito gasps )

317
00:18:20,317 --> 00:18:23,647
( cracking )

318
00:18:23,647 --> 00:18:24,657
( Administrator gasps )

319
00:18:24,657 --> 00:18:25,617
( yells )

320
00:18:33,617 --> 00:18:35,537
♪

321
00:18:43,337 --> 00:18:44,717
( Kirito gasps )

322
00:18:57,727 --> 00:18:59,517
( gasping )

323
00:19:17,997 --> 00:19:19,997
Administrator:
I DID NOT SEE THAT COMING.

324
00:19:21,457 --> 00:19:23,377
IN TERMS OF PRIORITY LEVEL,

325
00:19:23,377 --> 00:19:25,297
THE SWORD THAT FUSED WITH EUGEO

326
00:19:25,297 --> 00:19:28,587
WAS NO MATCH FOR MY BLADE,
THE SILVERY ETERNITY.

327
00:19:28,587 --> 00:19:33,767
BUT I DID NOT REALIZE
HIS SWORD WAS NOT METALLIC.

328
00:19:33,767 --> 00:19:35,177
THAT WAS MY MISTAKE.

329
00:19:41,267 --> 00:19:42,777
WHAT A BOTHER.

330
00:19:42,777 --> 00:19:46,487
SO, IT SEEMS YOU ARE
THE LAST ONE STANDING.

331
00:19:46,487 --> 00:19:49,447
SURPRISING, TO SAY THE LEAST,
BOY FROM THE OTHER SIDE.

332
00:19:49,447 --> 00:19:51,907
I AM STILL CURIOUS
AS TO WHY YOU’RE HERE

333
00:19:51,907 --> 00:19:54,367
WITHOUT
ADMINISTRATOR PRIVILEGES,

334
00:19:54,367 --> 00:19:57,157
ALTHOUGH, AT THIS POINT,
IT DOESN’T MATTER.

335
00:19:58,247 --> 00:19:59,167
( blows )

336
00:20:02,797 --> 00:20:05,917
NOW THE FIGHT IS OVER,
I’M SLEEPY.

337
00:20:05,917 --> 00:20:08,507
I’LL ASK THE OTHER BOY
FROM THE OUTER WORLD

338
00:20:08,507 --> 00:20:10,927
WHY YOU WERE HERE
AFTER I FILL MY CHAMBER

339
00:20:10,927 --> 00:20:13,097
WITH YOUR BLOOD AND SCREAMS.

340
00:20:16,767 --> 00:20:19,147
THIS IS THE END, BOY.

341
00:20:20,517 --> 00:20:22,397
PERHAPS WE WILL
MEET AGAIN SOMEDAY

342
00:20:22,397 --> 00:20:24,067
ON THE OTHER SIDE.

343
00:20:26,317 --> 00:20:27,857
♪

344
00:20:27,857 --> 00:20:29,447
( Kirito gasps )

345
00:20:30,987 --> 00:20:32,867
IT’S HAPPENING AGAIN.

346
00:20:37,457 --> 00:20:39,787
I’M LETTING IT HAPPEN AGAIN.

347
00:20:41,707 --> 00:20:44,297
Cardinal: YOU DO NOT
HAVE TO WIN ALL THE TIME,

348
00:20:44,297 --> 00:20:46,757
AND, IF YOU LOSE,
WHAT DOES IT EVEN MATTER?

349
00:20:46,757 --> 00:20:48,877
IN THE END, WHAT DOES

350
00:20:48,877 --> 00:20:51,637
IS THAT YOUR HEART
AND WILL ARE REMEMBERED.

351
00:20:51,637 --> 00:20:54,887
I AM CERTAIN EVERYONE
WHO HAS SPENT TIME WITH YOU

352
00:20:54,887 --> 00:20:57,807
AND MOVED ON TO OTHER PLANES
BELIEVED THAT,

353
00:20:57,807 --> 00:20:59,687
AS DO I.

354
00:20:59,687 --> 00:21:02,807
WE HAVE GIVEN YOU
THE STRENGTH TO STAND,

355
00:21:02,807 --> 00:21:06,527
SO STAND AND
PROTECT THOSE YOU HOLD DEAR.

356
00:21:06,527 --> 00:21:08,437
♪

357
00:21:19,657 --> 00:21:20,787
( Kirito grunts )

358
00:21:27,377 --> 00:21:28,667
Alice: WELL, NOW,

359
00:21:28,667 --> 00:21:32,337
YOU CAN MOVE, CAN’T YOU?

360
00:21:32,337 --> 00:21:33,887
Kirito: YEAH.

361
00:21:33,887 --> 00:21:35,717
I CAN TAKE IT FROM HERE.

362
00:21:35,717 --> 00:21:37,557
Alice: IF YOU WISH.

363
00:21:37,557 --> 00:21:39,307
HAVE AT IT.

364
00:21:39,307 --> 00:21:40,807
♪

365
00:21:40,807 --> 00:21:42,307
( chorus vocalizing )

366
00:21:45,187 --> 00:21:48,897
Kirito: YOU FOUGHT HARD, ALICE,
AND NOW IT’S MY TURN.

367
00:21:48,897 --> 00:21:52,777
CHARLOTTE, CARDINAL, AND EUGEO,

368
00:21:52,777 --> 00:21:54,907
THEY GAVE THEIR LIVES FOR MINE.

369
00:21:54,907 --> 00:21:56,867
NOW I’LL GIVE MINE FOR YOURS.

370
00:21:56,867 --> 00:21:59,197
( Administrator giggles )

371
00:22:04,997 --> 00:22:06,417
( singing in Japanese )

372
00:22:06,417 --> 00:22:09,167
♪

373
00:22:37,657 --> 00:22:39,947
♪ PROUD OF MYSELF ♪

